return {
    ["\n\n　　实践者的任务因此变得清晰：不是幻想打破极限，而是在极限之内逼近它。"] = " \n \n The practitioner's task therefore becomes clear: it is not to fantasize about breaking the limit, but to approach it within the limit.",
    ["\n嗨，小猫。\n　　一月不见，我猜你是陷入了那不知要花多久的“沉睡”。\n　　我马上会毕业离开霍伊大学，但作为一个信守诺言的男人，我亲手为你的苏醒准备了盛大的晚宴！我的父亲终于默许了我做饭的爱好，不管他认为这有多不体面。\n　　而这都要归功于你，我亲爱的朋友，在你挑剔舌头的点评后，我才终于敢把食物端给其他人。和你在一起的时光是那么纯粹，即使是纯粹的难吃，也让我无比想念。我父亲给我准备了精美厨具，但我还是更喜欢咱们破烂的简易灶台。\n　　等你苏醒！就直接来我家吧！\n　　我刚学会做新的因蒂斯酱烤小牛扒！迫不及待想让你尝尝味道了！\n　　期待你赶快醒来，我信赖的美食品鉴官。"] = "\nHi, kitten.\n　　It's been a month, and I guess you've fallen into that 'slumber' that I don't know how long will take.\n　　I will be graduating and leaving Hoy University soon, but as a man who keeps his promises, I have personally prepared a grand banquet for your awakening! My father has finally tacitly approved of my hobby of cooking, regardless of how unseemly he thinks it is.\n　　And all of this is thanks to you, my dear friend. It was only after your critical tongue's reviews that I finally dared to serve food to others. The time spent with you was so pure; even the pure bad taste makes me miss it immensely. My father prepared exquisite kitchenware for me, but I still prefer our broken, simple stove.\n　　When you wake up! Just come straight to my house!\n　　I just learned how to make a new Intis sauce-roasted veal steak! I can't wait for you to taste it!\n　　Looking forward to you waking up soon, my trusted food critic.",
    [" 无情嘲笑"] = "Mock mercilessly",
