    ["<Assistant_Title1>友情的重量</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>社交-好友聊天\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>拥有20个好友"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Weight of Friendship</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Have 20 friends",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>秘偶培养</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</>\n1、重复获取的秘偶会转化为<Assistant_Property1>秘偶碎片</>，转化的碎片数量和秘偶品质有关。碎片可用来进行<Assistant_Property1>秘偶培养</>。\n2、提升秘偶的培养度，会提高秘偶的<Assistant_Property1>属性增益</>。\n3、培养度达到特定阶段时，秘偶技能也会<Assistant_Property1>升阶</>，获得<Assistant_Red>额外的技能效果</>。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[获取秘偶]|536}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Marionette Cultivation</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions: </>\n1. Duplicate marionettes obtained will be converted into <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Fragments</>; the number of fragments converted depends on the marionette's quality. Fragments can be used for <Assistant_Property1>Marionette Cultivation</>. \n2. Increasing the cultivation level of a marionette will increase the marionette's <Assistant_Property1>attribute bonuses</>. \n3. When the cultivation level reaches a certain stage, the marionette's skills will also <Assistant_Property1>Ascend</>, gaining <Assistant_Red>additional skill effects</>. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Obtain marionette]|536}",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>做旧皮革・金衬叠穿・沉稳长风衣\n“我会回忆起那些我们携手探寻过的梦境，回忆起曾困扰我们的每一个非凡案件或封印物，回忆起风吹的方向，还有月亮的形状和颜色。”"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Distressed Leather · Gold-lined Layering · Steady Long Trench Coat \n \"I will recall those dreams we explored together, recall every Beyonder case or Sealed Artifact that once troubled us, recall the direction of the wind, and the shape and color of the moon.\"",
    ["<HighLight>00</>时<HighLight>22</>分<HighLight>59</>秒"] = "<HighLight>00</> hours <HighLight>22</> minutes <HighLight>59</> seconds",
    ["<P_Heart>（侧头，语气惊讶）</>贵族小姐也想学这个吗？我以为只有我这种不想当洗衣女的贫穷姑娘，才会想到来马戏团找一份出路。"] = "<P_Heart> (Tilts head, tone surprised) </> A noble lady wants to learn this too? I thought only poor girls like me, who don't want to be laundry maids, would think of coming to the circus to find a way out.",
    ["<P_Heart>（先在酒吧里转转……或许能打听到有用的线索。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I'll wander around the bar first... Maybe I can pick up some useful clues.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（抱怨）</>琳娜的未婚夫还在旁边，你小声些，我过一会去看看。"] = "<P_Heart>(Complaining)</> Linna's fiancé is still nearby, keep your voice down, I'll go check in a while.",
    ["<P_Heart>（无线电音）</>信号可算恢复了！你没事吧？"] = "<P_Heart>(Radio static)</> The signal is finally back! Are you okay?",
    ["<P_Heart>（皱眉）</>……现在，打扰你们的声音已经……永远消失了。"] = "<P_Heart> (Frowns) </>... Now, the voices disturbing you have... disappeared forever.",
    ["<P_Heart>（看来阿兹克先生了解非凡世界，也知道黑荆棘的情况。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(It seems Mr. Azik understands the Extraordinary World and also knows about the situation at Blackthorn.)</>",
