    ["……好，我愿意相信您。我们开始吧，让我想想……"] = "...Fine, I'm willing to trust you. Let's begin, let me think...",
    ["【成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演窥秘人】\n东区老街上有一间小屋，主人去世三个月了。邻居说每晚都能听见屋里有人翻东西的声音。"] = "【Unlocked after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Seer】\n There is a small house on the old street in the East District. The owner passed away three months ago. Neighbors say they can hear someone rummaging through things in the house every night.",
